Agentshake plugin for coding-agent hosts
Copyright 2026 codefulteam

This plugin contains only its manifests, a skill and a dependency-free launcher written by
codefulteam (https://github.com/codefulteam/agentshake). It bundles no third-party code. It runs a
separately installed agentshake engine package, whose own NOTICE lists the runtime dependencies
bundled in that package.
